  <!-- EN: automated turrets -->
  <GR_HasAutomatedTurrets_Scorned.stages.automated_turrets.label>torretas automatizadas</GR_HasAutomatedTurrets_Scorned.stages.automated_turrets.label>

  <!-- EN: Are we really using automated turrets? When we have the very power of creation in our fingertips? That's so lame. -->
  <GR_HasAutomatedTurrets_Scorned.stages.automated_turrets.description>Estamos mesmo usando torretas automatizadas? Quando temos o próprio poder da criação na ponta dos dedos? Que coisa sem graça.</GR_HasAutomatedTurrets_Scorned.stages.automated_turrets.description>

  <!-- EN: genetic failures -->
  <GR_Failures_Disliked.stages.genetic_failures.label>falhas genéticas</GR_Failures_Disliked.stages.genetic_failures.label>

  <!-- EN: One of our genetics experiments failed. We should get rid of it as soon as possible. -->
  <GR_Failures_Disliked.stages.genetic_failures.description>Um dos nossos experimentos genéticos falhou. Devemos nos livrar dele o mais rápido possível.</GR_Failures_Disliked.stages.genetic_failures.description>

  <!-- EN: genetic failures -->
  <GR_Failures_Shameful.stages.genetic_failures.label>falhas genéticas</GR_Failures_Shameful.stages.genetic_failures.label>

  <!-- EN: One of our genetics experiments failed, and a misshapen monstrosity is running around uncheked. We should get rid of it as soon as possible, for this shames us. -->
  <GR_Failures_Shameful.stages.genetic_failures.description>Um dos nossos experimentos genéticos falhou, e uma monstruosidade disforme anda por aí sem controle. Devemos nos livrar dela o mais rápido possível, pois isso nos envergonha.</GR_Failures_Shameful.stages.genetic_failures.description>

  <!-- EN: humanoid hybrids in colony -->
